id: hedge-your-bets
name: Hedge Your Bets
talentCategory: racial
race: demon
prerequisites: Demon Race
resource: riskaversion
resourceMax: 2
resourceLabel: Risk Aversion
description: >
  You don’t like to let the odds define you- by stacking the deck, you always know which card is about to be played.
text: >
  Hedge Your Bets: You don’t like to let the odds define you- by stacking the deck, you always know which card is about to be played.
  –Prerequisites: Demon Race
  (1)-[Triggered, Resource]: If you succeed at a Pressure Check, you may choose to fail instead. If you do, gain a stack of ‘Risk Aversion’ (max. 2).
  (2)-[Triggered]: If you gain a stack of Risk Aversion, regain 2(bT) Life and Ki Points.
  (3)-[Triggered]: If you fail a Pressure Check, you may spend a stack of Risk Aversion to increase the Dice Score of that Pressure Check by 2. This may cause your Pressure Check to succeed.

---

[passive]
# (1) A Pressure Check made: asked - a success failed instead, a stack of Risk Aversion; (2) with it, 2(bT) Life and Ki Points back;
# (3) a fail: a stack spent for 2 on it, asked (chat.mjs pressureCheck).
allow hedge.bets;
